Lichess puzzle database
https://database.lichess.org/lichess_db_puzzle.csv.zst
License: CC0 1.0 Universal

The JSON files in this directory are a filtered subset, generated by scripts/build-puzzles.mjs.
Each file is one course. A puzzle is kept when its opening tag is a position that course reaches,
the solver plays the course's side, and it passes the script's popularity and rating filters.
Up to 400 puzzles per course. Regenerate with: node scripts/build-puzzles.mjs
